Fiber Optic CAD Designer at Booker Engineering LLC | LinkedIn

**Fiber Optic CAD Designer**

**Booker Engineering LLC · Monroe, WA (On-site) · 2 weeks ago**

**About the job**

Booker Engineering LLC is seeking a Fiber Optic CAD Designer to join our growing team in Monroe, WA. This is a full-time, on-site position.

The successful candidate will be responsible for:

- Designing fiber optic network layouts using CAD and GIS tools
- Preparing construction drawings and permit packages
- Coordinating with project managers and field teams to ensure accuracy and compliance
- Supporting field data collection and design validation
- Utilizing Katapult or similar tools for field data workflows

**Qualifications:**

- Proficiency in AutoCAD Civil 3D, MicroStation, or equivalent design software
- Experience with GIS platforms such as ArcGIS or QGIS
- Familiarity with Katapult or similar field data collection tools
- Understanding of fiber optic network design principles, including FTTH/FTTP and OSP design
- Experience with OSP design standards and engineering drawings
- Understanding of local permitting processes and right-of-way (ROW) requirements
- Experience with Microsoft Office Suite

</content>
